{"id":"a41374cf828233e6","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-type-realization.md","title":"Realization of Type","display":"df-type-realization — Realization of Type","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-type-realization","aliases":["17-df-type-realization"],"display":"df-type-realization — Realization of Type","depends_on":["[[17-df-structure]]","[[17-df-type]]","[[17-df-realizing-omitting-formula-sets]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","source_section":"2.2","source_result":"Realization conventions; Example 2.2.5","source_pages_print":[77,78],"source_pages_djvu":[93,94],"source_verification":"definition compared in supplied DjVu OCR; original type interface extended to arbitrary finite-variable formula sets and arity bound internally","source_verification_history":["not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed"],"legacy_label":"17-df-1.8.2"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-type-realization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-type-realization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-type-realization — Realization of Type"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"07adad8c036296f7\" href=\"?note=07adad8c036296f7\" title=\"17-df-type\">17-df-type</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e1c067a42f0c312e\" href=\"?note=e1c067a42f0c312e\" title=\"17-df-realizing-omitting-formula-sets\">17-df-realizing-omitting-formula-sets</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_section","html":"2.2"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Realization conventions; Example 2.2.5"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>77</span><span>78</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93</span><span>94</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"definition compared in supplied DjVu OCR; original type interface extended to arbitrary finite-variable formula sets and arity bound internally"},{"key":"source_verification_history","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed</span></div>"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-df-1.8.2"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 为一阶语言；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 是候选公式集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar a\">\\(\\bar a\\)</span> 是候选有限元组。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\">\\(\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"07adad8c036296f7\" href=\"?note=07adad8c036296f7\" title=\"17-df-type\">17-df-type</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RealizesTuple}_{L,n}\">\\(\\operatorname{RealizesTuple}_{L,n}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Realizes}_{L,n}\">\\(\\operatorname{Realizes}_{L,n}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e1c067a42f0c312e\" href=\"?note=e1c067a42f0c312e\" title=\"17-df-realizing-omitting-formula-sets\">17-df-realizing-omitting-formula-sets</a>。以下定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Realizes}(\\mathfrak A,\\bar a,p)\">\\(\\operatorname{Realizes}(\\mathfrak A,\\bar a,p)\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Realized}_{\\mathfrak A}(p)\">\\(\\operatorname{Realized}_{\\mathfrak A}(p)\\)</span>，并在各自定义式内部绑定元数；对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\operatorname{Type}_n(T)\">\\(p\\in\\operatorname{Type}_n(T)\\)</span> 的原有调用仍适用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Realizes}(\\mathfrak A,\\bar a,p)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(p\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\n\\land\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^n\n\\land\\operatorname{RealizesTuple}_{L,n}(\\mathfrak A,\\bar a,p)\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Realized}_{\\mathfrak A}(p)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(p\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\n\\land\\operatorname{Realizes}_{L,n}(\\mathfrak A,p)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Realizes}(\\mathfrak A,\\bar a,p)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(p\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\n\\land\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^n\n\\land\\operatorname{RealizesTuple}_{L,n}(\\mathfrak A,\\bar a,p)\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Realized}_{\\mathfrak A}(p)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(p\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\n\\land\\operatorname{Realizes}_{L,n}(\\mathfrak A,p)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §2.2 印刷 pp.77–78，尤其 Example 2.2.5 的型实现。本地旧定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 是自由参数，但省略类型定理的调用把不同元数的型放在同一族中；现将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 绑定在谓词内部，调用签名保持不变。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in S_n(T)\">\\(p\\in S_n(T)\\)</span>，它包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\">\\(\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\\)</span> 内每个恒真公式，且不含带额外自由变量的公式；故该完整型的最小显示元数恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>。在较大显示元数中的实现与长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的实现等价：非空载体使元组可扩张，自由变量一致性使真值不变。部分型可能允许多个显示元数，同一理由保证第二式与原来任一合法元数的语义等价。第一式则由候选元组的长度唯一确定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>，不会把不同长度的元组混同。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-type","status":"resolved","id":"07adad8c036296f7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-realizing-omitting-formula-sets","status":"resolved","id":"e1c067a42f0c312e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-realizing-omitting-formula-sets]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 为一阶语言；$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$ 见 [[17-df-structure]]；$p$ 是候选公式集，$\\bar a$ 是候选有限元组。$\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$ 见 [[17-df-type]]；$\\operatorname{RealizesTuple}_{L,n}$ 与 $\\operatorname{Realizes}_{L,n}$ 见 [[17-df-realizing-omitting-formula-sets]]。以下定义 $\\operatorname{Realizes}(\\mathfrak A,\\bar a,p)$ 和 $\\operatorname{Realized}_{\\mathfrak A}(p)$，并在各自定义式内部绑定元数；对 $p\\in\\operatorname{Type}_n(T)$ 的原有调用仍适用。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-type","status":"resolved","id":"07adad8c036296f7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 为一阶语言；$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$ 见 [[17-df-structure]]；$p$ 是候选公式集，$\\bar a$ 是候选有限元组。$\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$ 见 [[17-df-type]]；$\\operatorname{RealizesTuple}_{L,n}$ 与 $\\operatorname{Realizes}_{L,n}$ 见 [[17-df-realizing-omitting-formula-sets]]。以下定义 $\\operatorname{Realizes}(\\mathfrak A,\\bar a,p)$ 和 $\\operatorname{Realized}_{\\mathfrak A}(p)$，并在各自定义式内部绑定元数；对 $p\\in\\operatorname{Type}_n(T)$ 的原有调用仍适用。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-realizing-omitting-formula-sets","status":"resolved","id":"e1c067a42f0c312e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 为一阶语言；$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$ 见 [[17-df-structure]]；$p$ 是候选公式集，$\\bar a$ 是候选有限元组。$\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$ 见 [[17-df-type]]；$\\operatorname{RealizesTuple}_{L,n}$ 与 $\\operatorname{Realizes}_{L,n}$ 见 [[17-df-realizing-omitting-formula-sets]]。以下定义 $\\operatorname{Realizes}(\\mathfrak A,\\bar a,p)$ 和 $\\operatorname{Realized}_{\\mathfrak A}(p)$，并在各自定义式内部绑定元数；对 $p\\in\\operatorname{Type}_n(T)$ 的原有调用仍适用。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar a","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RealizesTuple}_{L,n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Realizes}_{L,n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Realizes}(\\mathfrak A,\\bar a,p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Realized}_{\\mathfrak A}(p)","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\operatorname{Type}_n(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Realizes}(\\mathfrak A,\\bar a,p)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(p\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\n\\land\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^n\n\\land\\operatorname{RealizesTuple}_{L,n}(\\mathfrak A,\\bar a,p)\\Bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Realized}_{\\mathfrak A}(p)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(p\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\n\\land\\operatorname{Realizes}_{L,n}(\\mathfrak A,p)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in S_n(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false}],"bytes":2565,"backlinks":[{"id":"6c973042c939008f","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Realized}$ (realization predicate, see [[17-df-type-realization]])"},{"id":"e1c067a42f0c312e","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书首先对任意有限元数公式集定义实现和省略，并不要求该公式集一致或极大。本库 [[17-df-type-realization]] 的原有接口只声明对部分型使用；此新接口覆盖原书扩展省略类型定理需要的任意公式集。对部分型输入，它与原有赋值版本等价，因为有限元组可扩张为总赋值，且自由变量之外的赋值不影响真值。"},{"id":"7a9661711dbc540e","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 为一阶语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$。$|L|$ 与 $\\aleph_0$ 见 [[17-df-language-cardinality]]；$\\operatorname{Complete}$ 见 [[17-df-theory-properties]]；$S_n(T)$ 见 [[17-df-type]]；$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ 见 [[17-df-model]]。$m:\\omega\\to\\omega$，$(p_n)_{n\\in\\omega}$ 为公式集序列。$\\operatorname{Realized}_{\\mathfrak A}$ 见 [[17-df-type-realization]]，$\\operatorname{NonIsolated}_T$ 见 [[17-df-non-isolated-types]]；两接口均在内部绑定有限元数。一般公式集的实现及局部省略见 [[17-df-realizing-omitting-formula-sets]]、[[17-df-local-omission]]，证明使用 [[17-thm-extended-omitting-types]]。"},{"id":"979cffef60954613","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S_n(T)$ and $\\operatorname{Realized}$ (complete types and realization, see [[17-df-type]] and [[17-df-type-realization]])"},{"id":"84d09aff18243439","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Realized}$ (type-realization predicate, see [[17-df-type-realization]])"},{"id":"13c73c6f79ee78a7","anchor":"ref-32","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-type-realization]]"},{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-141","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-compactness]]\n[[17